Error [jet.FieldWriteWithoutMarker]: `.push()` changes `xs`, which has read access only
  --> tests/ui/param_read_write_fix.jet:2:22
    |
  2 | bad: fn(xs: [Int]) { xs.push(1) }
    |                      ^^
 Why: `push: fn(&self, Int)` changes the value it's called on, but an unmarked parameter gives read access only
 Fix: Change the parameter to `xs: &[Int]`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205
